  "body": "When the v2 API gains ability to tell clients this, we should tell them if they're trying to sync up from a presence stream token that's so old it fell off the back of the remote_offline_serials list, as it means we can't guarantee to tell the client about all the remote users who have since gone offline.\n\n(Imported from https://matrix.org/jira/browse/SYN-356)\n\n(Reported by @leonerd)",
